  "relapseMessage1": "康复不是线性的。每一步前进都很重要，包括这一步。",
  "@relapseMessage1": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage2": "你在这里，你在尝试，这需要真正的勇气。",
  "@relapseMessage2": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage3": "挫折不会抹去你的进步。你在学习和成长。",
  "@relapseMessage3": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage4": "每一次重新开始都是你力量的证明，而不是软弱的迹象。",
  "@relapseMessage4": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage5": "明天是一个新的开始。你能行的。",
  "@relapseMessage5": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage6": "你的价值不是由完美的连胜定义的。你很重要。",
  "@relapseMessage6": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage7": "康复是一段有起有落的旅程。继续前行。",
  "@relapseMessage7": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage8": "你以前有力量开始，现在你依然拥有。",
  "@relapseMessage8": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage9": "一瞬间并不能定义你未来的整个旅程。",
  "@relapseMessage9": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage10": "在这里表明你没有放弃。这很有力量。",
  "@relapseMessage10": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage11": "进步不在于完美，而在于坚持。",
  "@relapseMessage11": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage12": "每一次尝试都在建立韧性。继续建立。",
  "@relapseMessage12": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage13": "你再次尝试的承诺本身就是一种胜利。",
  "@relapseMessage13": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage14": "治愈不是瞬间的，而是伴随着你做出的每一个选择发生的。",
  "@relapseMessage14": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage15": "你不是从头开始——你是带着更多的智慧继续。",
  "@relapseMessage15": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage16": "每一位专家都曾是初学者。每一位职业选手都曾是业余爱好者。",
  "@relapseMessage16": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage17": "康复是一天一天发生的，有时是一小时一小时发生的。",
  "@relapseMessage17": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage18": "你正在书写一个东山再起的故事。这只是其中一章。",
  "@relapseMessage18": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage19": "你在这里这一事实意味着你在乎自己。坚持住。",
  "@relapseMessage19": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
  "relapseMessage20": "朝着正确方向迈出的一小步仍然是前进。",
  "@relapseMessage20": {
    "description": "Encouragement message for relapse"
  },
